  "en": {
    "id": 4063011,
    "name": "Ichor Memosprite: Winged Serpent (Bug)",
    "desc": "A false projection produced by compromised codes. The referenced entity is Ichor Memosprite: Winged Serpent, a distorted monster born from the fusing of a memetic lifeform from the Garden of Recollection and the golden ichor of \"Destruction.\" It is in the rudimentary form of a flying snake, enough to intimidate its assailants.\\nIts twisted rationality went completely mad in the black tide, and that intense self-defense impulse imperceptibly took on a fantastical hue.",
